  "created_at": "2026-09-04T05:53:24.321Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-09-04T05:55:08.530Z",
  "scope": [
    "Add a deterministic, Provider-neutral onboarding-plan command that reads a local normalized catalog, compatibility evidence, explicit preferences, and optional aggregate usage history, then returns a non-mutating model-profile recommendation with provenance and unknowns."
  ],
  "acceptance_criteria": [
    "The command never contacts a Provider, changes project policy, starts model execution, or consumes model quota.",
    "A compatible explicit preference can seed a recommendation; aggregate history is labeled as a familiarity prior rather than quality proof.",
    "Unqualified catalog entries remain discovered-only, conflicting or insufficient evidence remains unresolved, and missing facts are never inferred from model names or chat history.",
    "The output separates discovered, compatible, proposed, adopted, requested, and effective states and includes machine-readable authority flags.",
    "Focused contract tests, schema validation, repository verification, and independent QA pass at an exact revision."
  ],
